{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "An axis whose ticks cannot be made (an interval string on a linear scale) stops vega's dataflow at that axis, in its own scope: the axes before it stand where they were encoded, and nothing after it in that scope -- its marks, its legends -- nor the groups built after it. This one is in a nested group (with a literal scale), between complete groups; the groups before it are complete.",
